    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Erased&quot; is an action-packed psychological whirlwind in a post-apocalyptic sci-fi world. Navigate an online, open-world adventure with fast-paced combat, rail grinding, and parkour. Interact with pets, NPCs, and graffiti. Embrace the culture through hip hop, Afro-beats, and K-pop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Parkour System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rail Grinding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast Paced Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pet System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Graffiti</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dance System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hip Hop, Afro -beats and K- Pop culture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Character Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large Scale War Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Emotional, Dream Based, Story line</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Karma System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Giant Dynamic Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live Concerts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Live Tournaments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
